ON CODE  A E  axillary tail lymph nodes  F J  entirety of deep margin of previous biopsy site  stellate mass  K M  representative sections of stellate mass previous biopsy cavity from medial to lateral  no margins   N  representative section of skin with scar  O  representative section of nipple  P  representative section of upper inner quadrant  at least 20cm from previous biopsy cavity  Q  representative section of lower inner quadrant  at least 20cm from previous biopsy cavity  R  representative section of lateral upper quadrant  at least 5cm from previous biopsy cavity  S T  additional axillary lymph nodes  Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
