y have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  29 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 13 29 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibroadipose tissue with a long single suture designating the medial aspect  a short double suture designating the superior and a long double suture designating the anterior aspect  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  the superior green and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm well delineated indurated  tan white focally hemorrhagic gritty mass which abuts the posterior  is 0 4cm from the anterior  0 7cm from the superior  1 0cm from the inferior  1 7cm from the lateral and 1 8cm from the medial margins respectively  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is tan yellow to pink lobulated  unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in A F as follows  A B  mass closest to posterior margin  C  mass to closest anterior margin  D  mass to closest superior margin and representative section of tumor  E F  uninvolved parenchyma with the medial margin radially sectioned in cassette E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast final inferior  are two irregular tan yellow to pink unoriented portions of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The specimens are serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette G H with the smaller portion in cassette G and the larger portion in cassette H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast final deep lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibroadipose tissue with black suture designating the surface farthest from the tumor  The sutured aspect is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable tan yellow to pink cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I L  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final medial superior margin  is a 7 0x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibrofatty tissue with two black sutures designating the surface farthest from the tumor  The sutured aspect is inked black  the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow to pink unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes M S  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  LYNN CORNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST LEFT  INFERIOR SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION PART C  BREAST LEFT  DEEP SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT  MEDIAL SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION , Unchecked.
