ltiple tan  firm nodular areas with adjacent granular less firm regions altogether measuring 7 x 4 x 2cm  The nodular areas extends to 0 2cm from the lateral  inferior  and lateral superior aspects of the specimen  and the granular less firm areas grossly abuts the medial margin  SECTION CODE  B  representative section of firm nodular area with closest anterior superolateral margin  C  representative section of firm nodular area with closest anterior superior margin  from medial aspect of specimen  D  representative section of firm nodular area with closest lateral inferior margin  E  lateral margin  F  medial margin  G  additional representative section of tumor  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  skin  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm skin ellipse excised to a depth of 0 5cm  The specimen is inked  bissected and submitted entirely in H I  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  superior medial left breast  are two fragments of irregularly shaped  firm  fibrofatty tissue  the larger measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and the smaller fragment masuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  Both fragments are inked entirely in black and serially sectioned to reveal a yellow cut surface  The specimens are submitted in their entirety in cassettes J through N  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  inferior medial left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregularly shaped  firm piece of fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is inked entirely in black and serially sectioned to reveal a white yellow cut surface with focal red brown areas  The specimen is submitted entirely in O and P  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  inferior lateral margin left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm irregularly shaped  firm  piece of fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is inked entirely in