is antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 11 55 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast biopsy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm nodular piece of tissue  with a hard tan white cut surface  a portion is frozen as frozen section  1  now submitted in cassette A  The remainder of the tissue is submitted entirely in cassettes B and C  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  LEFT BREAST BIOPSY   INVASIVE LOBULAR CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
