 receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  16 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 09 58 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  s name and unit nubmer  and further labeled  left breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm breast  inspected and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm hard  tan  well defined mass abutting the posterior medial margin which is inked in green  A representative section is frozen as FX  1  and now submitted in cassette A  The remainder of the specimen is inked as follows  Lateral and medial   red  anterior   black  posterior   green  superior   blue  B D  mass  tumor on medial margin  E  short stitch F H  unremarkable breast Resident  GARY LETTS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LEFT BREAST MASS   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA CONSISTENT WITH DUCTAL  O R  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Paul Snowden Russell  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
