ph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire post lumpectomy site  with closest anterior and posterior margins and surrounding dense breast parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the breast parenchyma from the outer lower quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the breast parenchyma from the inner upper quadrant  Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is an oriented 14 x 13 x 1cm left simple nipple sparing mastectomy specimen with a stitch at 6 o clock  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior   blue  posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal predominantly tan white rubbery fibrous tissue with a minimal amount of tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  No discrete mass or lesion is noted  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma from the inner lower quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma from the inner upper quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma from the central region   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma from the outer upper quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma from the outer lower quadrant  Received in formalin  labeled  left nipple biopsy   are 2 tan white  focally fragmented soft tissues which measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  which are wrapped and submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right nipple biopsy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan brown irregular soft tissue fragment  which is inked black  trisected and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Adriana Dionigi Corben M D   Electronically signed on Monday February 02   R